[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/comments/1796486716","html_url":"https://github.com/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/642#issuecomment-1796486716","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/642","id":1796486716,"node_id":"IC_kwDOHKK-iM5rFDY8","user":{"login":"dstadulis","id":15150758,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTUwNzU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15150758?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis","html_url":"https://github.com/dstadulis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-06T21:14:01Z","updated_at":"2023-11-06T21:14:14Z","body":"Choose between 3 options.\r\n\r\nCould descope it","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/comments/1796486716/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/comments/1799923518","html_url":"https://github.com/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/642#issuecomment-1799923518","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/642","id":1799923518,"node_id":"IC_kwDOHKK-iM5rSKc-","user":{"login":"dstadulis","id":15150758,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MTUwNzU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15150758?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis","html_url":"https://github.com/dstadulis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dstadulis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-07T20:19:11Z","updated_at":"2023-11-07T20:26:07Z","body":"Potential user story:\r\nAs a `admin of a large universe server` I want to `reduce the server load I/O when querying for assets` in order to `reduce my server costs`\r\n\r\nMy notes/highlights on the three options available to be implimented:\r\n\r\n1. adding a background compaction goroutine. We'd create a new sub-system, that would compact in the background.\r\n2. query the table directly, instead of joining over millions of rows to find a single response.\r\n3. using atomic in memory counters that are periodically flushed to disk","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/comments/1799923518/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/comments/1800937220","html_url":"https://github.com/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/642#issuecomment-1800937220","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/642","id":1800937220,"node_id":"IC_kwDOHKK-iM5rWB8E","user":{"login":"jharveyb","id":16675200,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2Njc1MjAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16675200?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb","html_url":"https://github.com/jharveyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jharveyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-11-08T03:05:05Z","updated_at":"2023-11-08T03:05:05Z","body":"\r\n>     1. Each proof query launches a new goroutine to append to the log. This can really start to build up, particularly with a ton of spammy concurrent clients and no rate limiting.\r\n\r\nCould address by having those callsites create a log update and pass it via shared queue to a single background writer, that flushes on a short timer. Though this would only address goroutine churn and not the total # of writes.\r\n\r\n>     2. We use a non-materialized view to obtain query aggregate stats. This mean doing several joins over a table with tens of millions of rows.\r\n\r\nIIUC materialized views aren't supported by SQLite, and the more portable option would be table [triggers](https://www.postgresql.org/docs/16/sql-createtrigger.html)?\r\n\r\nMentioning not because I expect a universe server with many stats to be using SQLite, but that we probably don't want to tie having any stats available to using Postgres.\r\n\r\n> ### Log Compaction\r\n\r\n👍🏽  I think we need to add some new fields to the stats tables to allow for such deltas but SGTM.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/lightninglabs/taproot-assets/issues/comments/1800937220/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]